Column name: bom_longitude Type: FLOAT Description: Longitude from Australian Bureau of Meterology
Column name: bom_r64_sw Type: NUMBER Description: These are the mean radius (from the system centre) of the extent of winds; hurricane-force (33m/s) or above. Southwest quadrant
Column name: dist2land Type: NUMBER Description: Distance to land from the current position. The land dataset includes all continents and any islands larger than XX. The distance is the nearest at the present time in any direction.
Column name: td9636_latitude Type: FLOAT Description: Latitude from Dataset of a collection of global storms (1842-1980)
